    "Try again. If it keeps failing, remove the tool and reinstall. (%@)" : {
      "comment" : "Error message. %@ = a line of output from SteamCMD (in English).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
